@startuml
!include _style.iuml
autonumber
actor User
participant "Web client\n(axios interceptor)" as FE
participant "FastAPI\n/auth" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
User -> FE : enter e-mail and password
FE -> API : POST /auth/login (OAuth2 form)
API -> DB : check rate_limit_hits
API -> DB : load user, verify argon2 hash
API --> FE : access JWT (30 min) + refresh JWT (7 days)
FE -> API : GET /resource (Bearer access)
API -> API : get_current_user: verify type=access,\nstatus ACTIVE, must_change_password
API -> DB : effective_permissions(user, project)
API --> FE : 200 data
... access token expires ...
FE -> API : GET /resource
API --> FE : 401 (expired)
FE -> API : POST /auth/refresh (single-flight)
API -> DB : refresh token hash in revoked_tokens?
API -> DB : store old token hash (single use)
API --> FE : new access + refresh pair
FE -> API : retry original request
API --> FE : 200 data
@enduml
